sql_script.info:
Enter SQL statements (DDL, DML, or DQL). Multiple statements can be separated by semicolons.

For MongoDB datasources, use JSON format:
• Query: {"collection": "users", "operation": "find", "filter": {"age": {"$gt": 18}}}
• Insert: {"collection": "users", "operation": "insertOne", "document": {"name": "John"}}
• Update: {"collection": "users", "operation": "updateMany", "filter": {}, "update": {"$set": {"status": "active"}}}
• Delete: {"collection": "users", "operation": "deleteMany", "filter": {"age": {"$lt": 18}}}
